---
import ServicePage from '../layouts/ServicePage.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { serviceBySlug } from '../data/services';
const service = serviceBySlug('prescriptions')!;

const faqs = [
  { q: 'Do you accept eScripts?', a: 'Yes. Show us the QR code in your SMS or email at the prescription counter, or send it ahead through the Priceline Pharmacy app or MedAdvisor.' },
  { q: 'Can I fill a hospital prescription here?', a: 'Yes. We dispense hospital discharge scripts and private prescriptions as well as scripts from your GP.' },
  { q: 'Can you fill a prescription from another state?', a: 'Yes. A valid paper prescription or eScript from any Australian doctor can be filled here, so visitors to the Gold Coast are welcome.' },
  { q: 'Can you fill a prescription written overseas?', a: 'No. Prescriptions written outside Australia can’t be dispensed here. The GPs at <a href="/help-medical/">Help Medical</a>, inside our store, can see you and write an Australian prescription if appropriate.' },
  { q: 'Do you dispense veterinary prescriptions?', a: 'Yes. Bring in your pet’s script from your vet and we’ll dispense it where the medicine is one we can supply.' },
  { q: 'Can you order in a medicine you don’t have?', a: 'Usually, yes. We work with several wholesalers and can source most medicines, including specialised and hard-to-find ones. Call us with the details and we’ll let you know how quickly we can get it in.' },
  { q: 'Do you deliver prescriptions?', a: 'We don’t offer a regular prescription delivery service, and prescription medicines can’t be ordered through Uber Eats. In an urgent situation, call us: if a team member is available we may be able to arrange a delivery for a fee, but we can’t guarantee it.' },
];
---

<ServicePage
  service={service}
  title="Prescriptions & eScripts Broadbeach | Priceline Pacific Fair"
  description="Fill paper scripts and eScripts fast at Pacific Fair, Broadbeach. Send scripts ahead with the app; hospital, interstate and vet scripts; hard-to-find medicines."
  h1="Prescriptions at Pacific Fair, Broadbeach"
  lead="Filling a script at Priceline Pharmacy Pacific Fair is quick and simple. Bring in a paper script, show us an eScript on your phone, or send it ahead through the app so it’s ready when you arrive. Our pharmacists will take the time to answer your questions."
  faqs={faqs}
  primaryCta={{ label: 'Send a script with the app', href: '/download-the-priceline-app/', event: 'send-script' }}
  secondaryCta={{ label: `Call ${site.phone}`, href: site.phoneHref, event: 'call' }}
  dateModified="2026-10-07"
>
  <h2>How do I send my eScript ahead?</h2>
  <p>The easiest way to skip the wait is to send your eScript to us before you arrive, using the MedAdvisor app or the <a href="/download-the-priceline-app/">Priceline Pharmacy app</a>:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Open the app (or log in to MedAdvisor in your browser).</li>
    <li>Add your eScript: paste the token link, scan the QR code, or use Snap n Send.</li>
    <li>Choose <strong>Priceline Pharmacy Pacific Fair</strong>, Shop 81, Pacific Fair Shopping Centre, Broadbeach QLD 4218.</li>
    <li>Submit your order and we’ll let you know when it’s ready to collect.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Other ways to fill your prescription</h2>
  <h3>Show us your eScript in store</h3>
  <p>Come to the prescription counter at the back of the store and show us the QR code in your SMS or email.</p>
  <h3>Paper scripts</h3>
  <p>Hand your script to us at the prescription counter. If you’d rather not wait, do some shopping and collect it on your way out.</p>
  <h3>Active Script List</h3>
  <p>An Active Script List keeps all your eScripts in one place, so you don’t need to keep track of individual tokens. Ask us and we can register you in store. Once you’re set up, with your consent we can find your current scripts whenever you visit.</p>
  <h3>Scripts on file</h3>
  <p>We can keep your repeat prescriptions on file, so you don’t need to bring the paperwork each time.</p>
  <h3>Hospital, private and interstate prescriptions</h3>
  <p>We dispense hospital discharge scripts and private prescriptions as well as scripts from your GP. Prescriptions from doctors in other Australian states can be filled here too, which makes us a handy stop for visitors to the Gold Coast. Prescriptions written overseas can’t be dispensed in Australia; the GPs at <a href="/help-medical/">Help Medical</a>, inside our store, can help.</p>
  <h3>Veterinary prescriptions</h3>
  <p>We also dispense prescriptions written by your vet. Bring in the script and we’ll supply the medicine where it’s one we can stock or order.</p>

  <h2>Why is dispensing so fast here?</h2>
  <p>Our dispensary uses a robotic system that stores and picks medicines automatically. It finds the right medicine in seconds, which frees our pharmacists to spend more time checking your prescription and talking with you, not searching shelves.</p>

  <h2>Can you get hard-to-find medicines?</h2>
  <p>We work with several wholesalers and can order in most medicines, including specialised and less common ones. If a medicine is short nationally, we’ll let you know your options and speak to your doctor if needed. Call us on <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a> or email <a href={`mailto:${site.emailPharmacy}`}>{site.emailPharmacy}</a> to check availability.</p>

  <h2>Never run out</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/download-the-priceline-app/"><strong>Priceline Pharmacy app.</strong></a> Order your scripts and get reminders when repeats are due.</li>
    <li><a href="/medication-packing/"><strong>Medication packing.</strong></a> Your medicines organised by day and time in weekly blister packs.</li>
    <li><a href="/medication-reviews/"><strong>Medication reviews.</strong></a> A free one-on-one check if you take several medicines.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Need a new script?</h2>
  <p>The GPs at <a href="/help-medical/">Help Medical</a> are located inside our store, so you can see a doctor and fill your prescription in one visit.</p>

  <h2>Questions about your medicine?</h2>
  <p>Ask us anything: how to take it, side effects, or whether it’s safe with your other medicines, vitamins or supplements. There’s no appointment needed.</p>
</ServicePage>
